  "description": "Stunts is a modern interception library which implements the proxy pattern and runs everywhere, even where run-time code generation (Reflection.Emit) is forbidden or limitted, like physical iOS devices and game consoles, through compile-time code generation. The proxy behavior is configured in code using what we call a behavior pipeline.\n\n      IMyService service = Stunt.Of<IMyService>(); service.AddBehavior(...);",
